OL,3,GOrkney & Shetland
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FCloudy in the morning with
OL,6,Frain, heavy and persistent at times
OL,7,Fespecially for Shetland. Rain begins
OL,8,Fto clear north in the afternoon but
OL,9,Fmay linger for Shetland for much of
OL,10,Fthe day. Windy at times too.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FWinds easing and any
OL,13,Flingering rain clearing away from
OL,14,FShetland, otherwise a few clearer
OL,15,Fspells but still a risk of showers
OL,16,Fovernight.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
