OL,3,GOrkney & Shetland
OL,4,
OL,5,CFriday:FA mostly dry but cloudy start,
OL,6,Fa few showers may develop and more
OL,7,Foutbreaks of rain moving north over
OL,8,FOrkney in the afternoon, reaching
OL,9,FShetland later.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Saturday to Monday:
OL,12,FUnsettled over the weekend, shortlived
OL,13,Fbrightness on Saturday morning before
OL,14,Fa stormy spell with heavy rain at
OL,15,Ftimes and gales expected. Perhaps a
OL,16,Fbrighter day on Monday with lighter
OL,17,Fwinds.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
